      "description": "Reduce charge times at all charges: Charge 1: 5d -> 2d 12h Time Charge 2: 7d -> 4d Time Reduce charge costs at all charges: Charge 1: 11,000,000 -> 6,000,000 Gold Charge 2: 7,000,000 -> 3,500,000 Gold"
